{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31330","headline":"贺王仆射放榜 · 周墀","name":"贺王仆射放榜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文场三化鲁儒生，三十余年振重名。\n曾忝木鸡夸羽翼，又陪金马入蓬瀛。\n虽欣月桂居先折，更羡春兰最後荣。\n欲到龙门看风雨，关防不许暂离营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周墀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31330.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31330","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}